  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extensions, in particular the ground floor addition due to its siting, scale and bulk would result in an overly dominant, visually intrusive and discordant form of development not appearing subordinate to the existing property, detrimental to the character and appearance of the existing property and surrounding area.  This would be contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30, Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document 2014 and Policy 7.4 of the London Plan 2026.",
    "The single storey rear extension by reason of its size, siting, and excessive depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining properties Nos. 92 and 96 Wades Hill, resulting in a loss of light and outlook detrimental to the amenities of those adjoining properties contrary to Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy 2010 and Development Management Document (2014) Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37."
